# Owners per role (see docs/process.md "ロールと持ち主").
# This is a personal repository, so every role maps to @shoito for now.
# Replace with team handles when roles are staffed, e.g. @org/pm, @org/dev, @org/qa, @org/ops.
# Note: CODEOWNERS requires approval from any one listed owner; the PM + QA
# dual approval on changes/*/spec.md is enforced by the PR template and CI.

# Default: Dev
*                                   @shoito

# PM
/systems/*/docs/intent.md           @shoito
/systems/*/docs/roadmap.md          @shoito
/systems/*/docs/changes/*/intent.md @shoito

# PM + QA
/systems/*/docs/changes/*/spec.md   @shoito

# QA
/systems/*/docs/quality.md          @shoito
/systems/*/docs/changes/*/quality.md @shoito

# Ops
/systems/*/docs/runbooks/           @shoito

# CI, workflows, rulesets and spec checks: Dev (tech lead) + Ops
# (systems/slack/docs/architecture/security.md 7.3)
/.github/                           @shoito
/tools/                             @shoito

# API contract (Dev tech lead) — see systems/slack/docs/decisions/0008
/systems/*/packages/contract/       @shoito
/systems/*/packages/api-client/     @shoito
